# {{ project_name }}

{{ description }}. Built on [mlpipe](https://github.com/nranthony/mlpipe), a local,
agent-operated MLOps library pinned to a git tag in `pyproject.toml`. mlpipe gives this
repo a content-addressed store, signature-cached steps, one manifest per step
execution, lineage, MLflow views and the `mlpipe` CLI. This repo holds the domain:
its steps, configs and decisions. [DESIGN.md](DESIGN.md) is the design reference.

